  "status": "PENDULUM_CHAIN_MATERIAL_COMPLETION_REPAIRED",
  "finding": "Heat/Sear delegated legacy Chain Material routes now mark proper completion on actual Fusion summon success, through a temporary continuous native summon-event observer reset immediately after callback returns. Eight scoped original-source/current-installed-metadata cases pass: normal success/revival, failed-after-actual-banishment/illegal-revival exclusion, successful summon with immediate recipient departure/proper revival, and no leaked observer marking a later unrelated intentionally uncompleted Fusion. Old source actually permits four illegal revivals. Omitted completion/disabled restriction controls four failures each; field-location-only guard and retained-observer faults two failures each.",
  "qualification": "Full bundled legacy Chain Material39980304 activation/material selection/banishment/summon callback. Neutral trap metadata, recipient direct recipe/materials/restriction/probe. Heat field-seeded; Sear actual native Pendulum activation. Existing explicit test-only IsFaceupEx and empty mandatory-material mappings retained; no original mandatory-material/recipient/helper-version/live Omega certification. Different fixed-script SpecialSummonStep contract not substituted. Prior direct normal branch/native positives preserved; other printed clauses remain open.",
  "primary_rule": "https://www.yugioh-card.com/en/downloads/rulebook/SD_RuleBook_EN_10.pdf#page=15",
  "remaining": "Nine other delegated caller contexts remain original-effect test/repair candidates; no blanket helper return-value guard. Scarecrow/Windborne unchecked direct candidates remain without reachable failure proof.",
